# A hand-written optimal rewrite of 06_optimize_llm.pol (what a good LLM answer
# looks like). The fake model answers with it; the verifier must still prove it.
SUBJECT engineer, contractor, analyst
RESOURCE deploy_api SUPPORTS EXECUTE
RESOURCE config     SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE metrics    SUPPORTS READ

ALLOW engineer EXECUTE deploy_api WHEN on_call OR change_approved
ALLOW engineer ACCESS config
ALLOW contractor READ metrics WHEN on_vpn
ALLOW analyst READ metrics
